    "description": "Condition:\nThis vintage tobacco pipe shows significant signs of previous use and age. The bowl contains remaining residue and carbon buildup. The stem exhibits heavy oxidation and discoloration common with vulcanite materials. The gold-toned metal band shows noticeable tarnish and wear to the finish. Please review photos for a detailed view of the surface condition.\nThis vintage LHS Sterncrest tobacco pipe is a classic example of mid-century smoking craftsmanship. Crafted from imported briar, it features a deeply rusticated, textured finish on the bowl that provides a comfortable grip and a rugged aesthetic. The shank is clearly stamped with the LHS Sterncrest diamond logo and \"Imported Briar\" hallmarks. A decorative gold-toned band connects the shank to a curved bent stem. This piece serves as a characteristic collectible for pipe enthusiasts or a restoration project for a vintage smoking collection.\nBrand: LHS\nModel: Sterncrest\nMaterial: Imported Briar\nFinish: Rusticated / Carved\nStyle: Bent Stem\nFeatures: Decorative metal band, diamond shank stamping",
